OL,3,AFamily tribute to 'kind and loving' GP
OL,4,Afound dead at home
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a GP who was found dead
OL,7,Fat her home say they have been
OL,8,F"devastated" by her death.
OL,10,FPolice discovered the body of Hannah
OL,11,FCain, known to her patients as Dr
OL,12,FHannah Terry, at her home in
OL,13,FDersingham, Norfolk, on Sunday morning.
OL,15,F"She was kind, generous and loving; a
OL,16,Fbeloved mother, daughter, sister,
OL,17,Fauntie, daughter-in-law and friend,"
OL,18,Fthe 45-year-old's family said in a
OL,19,Fstatement.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
