OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ANational memorial under way in Tel Aviv
OL,4,Aas Israelis mark three years since 7
OL,5,AOctober attacks
OL,6,
OL,7,FCommemorations in Israel began with a
OL,8,Fnationwide minute's silence at 06:29
OL,9,Flocal time (04:29 BST), to mark the
OL,10,Ftime the attacks started
OL,12,FIn response to the 7 October attacks,
OL,13,FIsrael launched a military offensive in
OL,14,FGaza in which more than 74,200 people
OL,15,Fhave been killed, according to the
OL,16,FHamas-run health ministry
OL,18,FIsrael does not allow international
OL,19,Fnews organisations, including the BBC,
OL,20,Finto Gaza to report freely
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
