OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AIsraelis demand accountability over 7
OL,4,AOctober failures three years after
OL,5,Aattacks
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe pain of those attacks is still
OL,8,Ffresh here. But three years on, there
OL,9,Fare questions about who else should pay
OL,10,Fthe price for Israel's security
OL,11,Ffailure.
OL,13,F"I need my country to take
OL,14,Fresponsibility," said Inbar Goldstein,
OL,15,Fwhose brother and niece were killed,
OL,16,Fand four other relatives kidnapped from
OL,17,FKfar Aza.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
